## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cff9b8cffMello|rUI Dungeon Info
## Notes: MelloUI's Dungeon Info: every dungeon and raid on the map, its bosses and what they drop, your own list of items to look out for in a loot roll, and a trip that picks up a dungeon's quests in the fastest order. Switch it on or off in MelloUI (/mello); untick it here to not load it at all.
## Author: Mello
## Version: 1.2.2
## Dependencies: MelloUI
## OptionalDeps: MelloUI_Oldschool, MelloUI_QuestList, MelloUI_Route, MelloUI_Map
## X-MelloUI-Feature: DungeonInfo
## SavedVariables: MelloUIDungeonInfoSaved
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: MelloUIDungeonInfoChar
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\MelloUI\Media\Textures\LogoIcon.tga

